---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SectionLabel from '../components/SectionLabel.astro';
---
<Layout title="What We Do | VR Entertainment" description="Explore VR Entertainment's service lines: artist management, content and production, and digital marketing for India's entertainment economy.">
  <section class="bg-background px-6 py-[100px] lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[840px] text-center">
      <h1 class="font-display text-[52px] leading-tight text-text-primary">What We Do</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-[18px] leading-[1.8] text-text-secondary font-[300]">We work with independent artists, venue and hospitality brands, and creators to build lasting careers, meaningful audiences, and premium creative content.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-surface px-6 py-[100px] lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1200px] flex-col gap-16">
      <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-text-tertiary font-[300]">ARTIST MANAGEMENT</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 text-[32px] font-display text-text-primary">Career development for independent artists.</h2>
          <p class="mt-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.8] text-text-secondary font-[300]">From your first 1,000 listeners to label conversations, we build the infrastructure around talent so artists can focus on their craft.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-text-primary font-[300]">
            <p>— Career strategy and roadmap</p>
            <p>— Content and brand direction</p>
            <p>— Industry introductions and booking coordination</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/artist-management" class="mt-8 inline-flex text-[14px] font-[500] text-accent hover:underline">Explore artist management →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[6px] border border-border bg-background p-10">
          <p class="text-[16px] leading-7 text-text-secondary">We select a small roster of artists and move with confidence. Our approach is built around long-term audience growth and cultural positioning.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:flex-row-reverse">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-text-tertiary font-[300]">CONTENT & PRODUCTION</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 text-[32px] font-display text-text-primary">End-to-end creative production for brands and creators.</h2>
          <p class="mt-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.8] text-text-secondary font-[300]">We deliver strategic content with strong production values so every release is crafted for attention, relevance and reach.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-text-primary font-[300]">
            <p>— Short-form social content series</p>
            <p>— Video, audio and brand film production</p>
            <p>— Post-production, editing and motion design</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/content-production" class="mt-8 inline-flex text-[14px] font-[500] text-accent hover:underline">Explore content production →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[6px] border border-border bg-background p-10">
          <p class="text-[16px] leading-7 text-text-secondary">We keep production lean and focused on the story. Fewer elements, stronger execution, measured by audience impact.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-text-tertiary font-[300]">DIGITAL MARKETING</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 text-[32px] font-display text-text-primary">Strategy-first marketing for entertainment brands.</h2>
          <p class="mt-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.8] text-text-secondary font-[300]">We combine culture-led digital campaigns with data and audience development, built for music, nightlife and creator economies.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-text-primary font-[300]">
            <p>— Social media strategy and publishing</p>
            <p>— Paid social, analytics and optimisation</p>
            <p>— Community growth and identity coordination</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/digital-marketing" class="mt-8 inline-flex text-[14px] font-[500] text-accent hover:underline">Explore digital marketing →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[6px] border border-border bg-background p-10">
          <p class="text-[16px] leading-7 text-text-secondary">Entertainment audiences need cultural understanding and timing. We plan for rhythms, moments and the creator-led marketplace.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-background px-6 py-[100px] lg:px-8">
    <SectionLabel label="HOW WE WORK" />
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1200px] gap-8 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {['Discovery','Strategy','Execution','Growth'].map((step, index) => (
        <div class="space-y-3 text-center md:text-left" key={step}>
          <div class="text-[36px] font-display text-accent opacity-50">0{index + 1}</div>
          <p class="text-[16px] font-[500] text-text-primary">{step}</p>
          <p class="text-[14px] leading-7 text-text-secondary font-[300]">{
            index === 0 ? 'We learn your world before we touch your brand.' :
            index === 1 ? 'We build a plan specific to your goals, audience, and market.' :
            index === 2 ? 'We produce, publish, and manage with full accountability.' :
            'We measure, optimise, and scale what works.'
          }</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-surface px-6 py-[100px] lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[840px] text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-[40px] leading-tight text-text-primary">Ready to work together?</h2>
      <a href="/contact" class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-[8px] border border-accent px-8 py-4 text-[14px] font-[500] text-accent hover:bg-accent hover:text-background transition duration-300 ease-in-out">Inquire</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
